{"tts": [{"out": "gelen/ruya/b03/s01_0_NARRATOR.mp3", "voice": "Brian", "lang": "en", "text": "Four nights left. And the runaway dream was getting bolder.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b03/s03_0_ANNA.mp3", "voice": "Sarah", "lang": "en", "text": "You were sleepwalking again last night. Your shoes were wet.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b03/s04_0_MIRA.mp3", "voice": "Jessica", "lang": "en", "text": "Weird dreams, I guess. Can I go early today?", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b03/s06_0_THEO.mp3", "voice": "Liam", "lang": "en", "text": "Mira. There is a fish. In the air. Looking at me.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b03/s07_0_MIRA.mp3", "voice": "Jessica", "lang": "en", "text": "Don't make eye contact. It's from someone's dream.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b03/s10_0_THEO.mp3", "voice": "Liam", "lang": "en", "text": "Okay, this is getting worse. Like, way worse.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b03/s11_0_MIRA.mp3", "voice": "Jessica", "lang": "en", "text": "Elias said daylight makes dreams stranger. It's trying to hide.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b03/s14_0_MIRA.mp3", "voice": "Jessica", "lang": "en", "text": "There! The greenhouse!", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b03/s17_0_THEO.mp3", "voice": "Liam", "lang": "en", "text": "Okay. I take it back. This part is beautiful.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b03/s19_0_MIRA.mp3", "voice": "Jessica", "lang": "en", "text": "You don't have to hide. I just want to know who you belong to.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b03/s21_0_MIRA.mp3", "voice": "Jessica", "lang": "en", "text": "That's my house. That's\u2026 our star.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b03/s22_0_THEO.mp3", "voice": "Liam", "lang": "en", "text": "Your star? What do you mean?", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b03/s23_0_MIRA.mp3", "voice": "Jessica", "lang": "en", "text": "When I was little, someone showed me a star from our window. I don't remember who.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b03/s25_0_THEO.mp3", "voice": "Liam", "lang": "en", "text": "He's here. In daylight.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b03/s28_0_MIRA.mp3", "voice": "Jessica", "lang": "en", "text": "It's okay. I've got you. I promise.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b03/s30_0_THEO.mp3", "voice": "Liam", "lang": "en", "text": "Mira\u2026 if it's your dream, why don't you remember it?", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b03/s31_0_MIRA.mp3", "voice": "Jessica", "lang": "en", "text": "I don't know. But tonight, I'm going to find out.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}, {"out": "gelen/ruya/b03/s32_0_NARRATOR.mp3", "voice": "Brian", "lang": "en", "text": "Three nights left. And the dream had finally chosen to trust her.", "vs": {"stability": 0.45, "similarity_boost": 0.8, "style": 0.3}}]}